 "stimulus_html": "Determine whether the ordered pair is a solution to the system.\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}\n  x - 3y =  - 8 \\\\\n   - 3x - y = 4 \\\\ \n\\end{array}  \\right.\"></span>\n",
 "questions": [
